config BR2_PACKAGE_TIMED
	bool "timed"
	help
	  The clock of the stick, set from the host: an NTP client and a
	  PTP slave in one daemon, which sets the clock from the better of
	  the two that answer, and from the date the OLT gives when the
	  host gives none. From timed/ in this repository.
